    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/db6add07c887fa064abda583eedccce5.avif?t=1751898848\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Marty Clumsby has a cursed dick \u2014 and it\u2019s full of dangerously powerful magical essence!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life was already hard enough (pun intended), but now Marty\u2019s erection has become a ticking time bomb... and everyone around him has &quot;strange&quot; ideas on how to help.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/95c5a732d9c808c4ea2b21278aa8d101.poster.avif?t=1751898848\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/95c5a732d9c808c4ea2b21278aa8d101.webm?t=1751898848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/95c5a732d9c808c4ea2b21278aa8d101.mp4?t=1751898848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, Marty desperately searches for answers about his curse in a university full of suspicious professors, seductive classmates, and &quot;helpful&quot; counselors who may or may not want to milk him dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway hides a new awkward encounter... and some very tight challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/6fcb35792eb7c3ecc6c7dce1351f9fb1.poster.avif?t=1751898848\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/6fcb35792eb7c3ecc6c7dce1351f9fb1.webm?t=1751898848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/6fcb35792eb7c3ecc6c7dce1351f9fb1.mp4?t=1751898848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Build ridiculous towers. Survive seductive assaults. Defend your hard tower... or get absolutely wrecked.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night, he\u2019s pulled into a dream world where he must survive chaotic, sexy tower defense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armies of lustful factions \u2014 orc warrior queens, horny witches, bloodthirsty vampiresses, and mischievous fey \u2014 are desperate to drain the magic straight from his cock for their own twisted purposes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Harder You Fight, the Stronger You Get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you stand tall and resist the lustful hordes? Or will you leak, moan, and end up as a walking fountain for your enemies' pleasure?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about surviving the night \u2014 every victory powers Marty up, giving him new strength to resist temptations during the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through it all, he fights to become a better man (or at least a functional one) for Mina, the shy girl who turned his once boring life upside down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/ffcbf2f8f02d9e5f3cf4a3455d9c285b.poster.avif?t=1751898848\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708000/extras/ffcbf2f8f02d9e5f3cf4a3455d9c285b.apng?t=1751898848\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=318 /></picture></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Life Gameplay</strong> \u2014 Fight ho